# Current Assessment

Enterprise stewardship boundaries have been validated for all platform-owned enterprise capabilities.

These stewardship boundaries establish the authoritative enterprise responsibilities that will guide subsequent Analysis Findings (AF-EP) and Persistence Architecture (PA-EP).

Enterprise stewardship has been intentionally separated from implementation, persistence, orchestration, and technology to preserve constitutional separation of concerns.